      "notes": [
        {
          "id": 739757152,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "The previous implementation was getting the bit in oct and value and doing a bitshit (oct>>1), as seen below:\n```\n                proto_tree_add_uint_bits_format_value(vd_tree, hf_evs_bw, tvb, bit_offset, 1, 1, ENC_BIG_ENDIAN, \"BW: %s (%u)\",\n                    val_to_str_const(oct << 1, evs_bw_values, \"Unknown value\"),\n```\nSo value 0 should be decoded as WB and value 1 as SWB.\nCould you clarify what was wrong with the previous code?",
          "author": {
            "id": 6722527,
            "username": "pquantin",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Pascal Quantin",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/9bf49edc6acae0eca821eb90309381794fb4fbea4f3fb7c2378428862ddbb430?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/pquantin"
          },
          "created_at": "2021-11-22T08:43:45.038Z",
          "updated_at": "2021-11-22T08:44:01.622Z",
