        {
          "id": 739775818,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "The `oct` can only be `0` or `1`. From the code:\n```\nproto_tree_add_uint_bits_format_value(vd_tree, hf_evs_bw, tvb, bit_offset, 1, 1, ENC_BIG_ENDIAN, \"BW: %s (%u)\",\n                    val_to_str_const(oct << 1, evs_bw_values, \"Unknown value\"),\n\n```\n`oct << 1` can only be `0b00` or `0b10`, which are mapped to `NB` or `SWB` (https://gitlab.com/wireshark/wireshark/-/blob/master/epan/dissectors/packet-evs.c#L323).\nAlso a snapshot for current Wireshark decoding LP-CNG SID frame when BW is `0`:![Screenshot_2021-11-22_at_4.56.35_PM](/uploads/fe178aa16758dfcd454394025a95480b/Screenshot_2021-11-22_at_4.56.35_PM.png)",
          "author": {
            "id": 550305,
            "username": "NanXiao",
            "public_email": "",
            "name": "Nan Xiao",
            "state": "active",
            "locked": false,
            "avatar_url": "https://secure.gravatar.com/avatar/daf0442d9f2045c76af39777b10b07a956524a81a99e5e04e6a4b68555b85bf6?s=80&d=identicon",
            "web_url": "https://gitlab.com/NanXiao"
