        {
          "id": 739802268,
          "type": "DiffNote",
          "body": "To make things clear, the lines should be:\n```\noct = tvb_get_bits8(tvb, bit_offset, 1);\nproto_tree_add_uint_bits_format_value(vd_tree, hf_evs_bw, tvb, bit_offset, 1, 1, ENC_BIG_ENDIAN, \"%s (%u)\",\n                    val_to_str_const(1 << oct, evs_bw_values, \"Unknown value\"), oct);\n```\nThis should give you the right result while ensuring that hf_evs_bw uses the same evs_bw_values whatever the number of bit.",
